Containers/OpenSMART-Standalone/**/volumes/data/**
!Containers/OpenSMART-Standalone/**/volumes/data/.gitkeep
Containers/OpenSMART-Standalone/**/*.ovpn
Containers/OpenSMART-Standalone/**/*.key
